      desc="[Default: 1;0.8]  proportion of activation used for computing dopamine modulation value -- 1-pct_act comes from net-input -- activation is more differentiated and leads to more differentiated representations, but if there is no activation then dopamine modulation has no effect, so it depends on having that activation signal";
