    name="bvPVLVTask";
    short_nm="PVLVTask";
    tags=;
    desc="KEY PROGRAM: inner run program - This program should provide any user with a one-stop shop for following the full logic of how this project functions in a more or less iinear and human-understandable form.  It iterates as a continuous sequence of alpha-level trials so long as MasterTrain->stop_train is false.  At the start of each alpha-level iteration everything is contextualized by organizing sequences of alpha trials into distinct ecologically-defined trials (eco_trials) - multiple sequences (eco_trials_per_epoch) are aggregated as epochs - multiple epochs (train_epochs) make up one training run. Key parameters defining which specific eco trials are run, how many, and in what order are found in the MasterConfig table and the particular <env_params_table> specified there. ";
    version {
     major=0;
     minor=0;
     step=0;
    };
    author="Randall C. O'Reilly";
    email="emergent-users@grey.colorado.edu";
    flags=2;
